---
- Build a bright, high-quality, restrained executive presentation interface based on visual_references; not a busy monitoring dashboard.
- One primary visual per view, one contextual panel, large typography, spacious layout, thoughtful iconography and transitions.
- Keep presenter-only talk track in notes/drawer, NOT overlaying the visual.
- Render tabs, icons, scenes, domain cards and value layers from JSON configs, not hard-coded office-specific labels.
- Customer / Partner / Cisco + Ecosystem is a lens selector independent of current screen/mode.
- Live runs animate handoffs and display a selectable execution graph, while value context remains queryable.
- Ensure keyboard navigation, reduced motion, colour contrast, 1280x720 and mobile layouts.
